        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: As You Like It (2006 film), As You Like It\n- People: Kenneth Branagh, William Shakespeare, Bryce Dallas Howard, David Oyelowo, Romola Garai, Adrian Lester, Alfred Molina, Kevin Kline, Janet McTeer, Brian Blessed\n- Characters: Rosalind, Orlando De Boys, Celia, Oliver De Boys, Touchstone, Jaques, Audrey, Duke Frederick, Duke Senior\n\nFacts:\n- In 1600, William Shakespeare's play As You Like It featured Rosalind as its heroine and protagonist.\n- In 2006, Kenneth Branagh wrote and directed the film As You Like It, which was based on William Shakespeare's play of the same name.\n- In 2006, the film As You Like It starred Bryce Dallas Howard as Rosalind, David Oyelowo as Orlando De Boys, Romola Garai as Celia, Adrian Lester as Oliver De Boys, Alfred Molina as Touchstone, Kevin Kline as Jaques, Janet McTeer as Audrey, and Brian Blessed as both Duke Frederick and Duke Senior.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
